# Ever Grande City (Emerald's MUS_EVER_GRANDE role) and its two halls below and above Victory Road: a broad, sunny
# theme in B-flat major for the city of flowers at the League's foot, a trumpet's proud line over held strings, horns
# answering in long notes, a walking bass and a light, steady beat, like a last breath of sea air before the summit. A
# softer horn takes the line after dark. Original composition for this game (plan 21 · H9).
